{"version":1,"content":"<p>【有 Backup ⚠️】俄羅斯科技巨頭 Yandex 12 日在社交平台 X 發文，證實旗下數據中心嚴重受損，大部分用戶目前無法查詢餘額、進行消費扣款或轉帳。</p><p>Yandex 金融科技部門負責人 Dima Pirogov 強調，被炸的是「伺服器」、民眾的「存款」依然安全，呼籲俄羅斯民眾無須恐慌。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:20:09.258065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:15:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:40.947099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:17:39.674894+00:00","content_hash":"df21bf723995b91a813d64431bea74ff68802cb0b525af8d51a13bbddc3b8307","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}